ction><div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><button type="button" class="bg-gold px-5 py-2.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-paper">All Cases</button><button type="button" class="border border-paper/30 px-5 py-2.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-paper/80 transition-colors hover:border-gold hover:text-gold-tint">MSME Consulting</button><button type="button" class="border border-paper/30 px-5 py-2.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-paper/80 transition-colors hover:border-gold hover:text-gold-tint">Institution Building</button><button type="button" class="border border-paper/30 px-5 py-2.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-paper/80 transition-colors hover:border-gold hover:text-gold-tint">Feasibility Studies</button></div></div></section><section class="section-y"><div class="shell space-y-20"><div><p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold-deep">MSME Consulting</p><h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">Business<br/><span class="text-charcoal/70">Transformations</span></h2><div class="mt-2 h-1 w-10 bg-gold"></div><div class="mt-8 space-y-6"><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><article class="grid border border-ink-tint md:grid-cols-3"><div class="bg-card p-7 md:col-span-2 md:p-9"><p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold-deep">Case Study <!-- -->01<!-- --> · <!-- -->Rubber &amp; Plastics Manufacturing</p><p class="mt-1 text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">Gujarat<!-- --> · <!-- -->GAP360™ Full Cycle · 90 Days</p><h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Rubber &amp; Plastics Manufacturer</h3><p class="mt-5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">The Challenge</p><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">A recurring pattern of material wastage had been silently compounding for months, alongside delivery delays frequent enough to put customer relationships at risk.</p><p class="mt-5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">What SBC Did</p><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">SBC deployed the GAP360™ framework across the full operational cycle, mapping root causes and building floor-level accountability over 90 days.</p><div class="mt-6 flex justify-end"><a href="/case-studies/rubber-plastics-manufacturer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Read Full Case Study <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-between bg-ink-wash p-7 md:p-9"><div><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">Results</p><div class="mt-5 space-y-5"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-3xl text-ink">0%→84%</p><p class="mt-2 font-medium text-[11px] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft">On-Time Delivery</p></div><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-3xl text-ink">0%↓</p><p class="mt-2 font-medium text-[11px] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft">Material Wastage</p></div><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-3xl text-ink">₹0L+</p><p class="mt-2 font-medium text-[11px] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft">Annual Cost Saving</p></div><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-3xl text-ink">0 Days</p><p class="mt-2 font-medium text-[11px] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft">Full Implementation</p></div></div></div><div class="mt-6 inline-flex w-fit items-center bg-ink px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-medium leading-snug text-paper">GAP360™ Full Cycle · 90 Days</div></div></article></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><article class="grid border border-ink-tint md:grid-cols-3"><div class="bg-card p-7 md:col-span-2 md:p-9"><p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold-deep">Case Study <!-- -->02<!-- --> · <!-- -->Industrial Components Manufacturing</p><p class="mt-1 text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">Gujarat<!-- --> · <!-- -->GAP360™ Systems &amp; Accountability · 60 Days</p><h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Industrial Components Manufacturer</h3><p class="mt-5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">The Challenge</p><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">The founder was the de facto decision-maker for every operational matter, with no reporting structure or inter-departmental accountability.</p><p class="mt-5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">What SBC Did</p><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">SBC designed a 3-tier reporting structure with defined KRAs/KPIs and weekly review cadences over 60 days.</p><div class="mt-6 flex justify-end"><a href="/case-studies/industrial-components-manufacturer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Read Full Case Study <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-between bg-ink-wash p-7 md:p-9"><div><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">Results</p><div class="mt-5 space-y-5"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-3xl text-ink">0 hrs/wk</p><p class="mt-2 font-medium text-[11px] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft">Founder Time Freed</p></div><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-3xl text-ink">0-Tier</p><p class="mt-2 font-medium text-[11px] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft">Reporting Structure Built</p></div><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-3xl text-ink">0 Days</p><p class="mt-2 font-medium text-[11px] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft">Accountability System Live</p></div></div></div><div class="mt-6 inline-flex w-fit items-center bg-ink px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-medium leading-snug text-paper">GAP360™ Systems &amp; Accountability · 60 Days</div></div></article></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><article class="grid border border-ink-tint md:grid-cols-3"><div class="bg-card p-7 md:col-span-2 md:p-9"><p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold-deep">Case Study <!-- -->03<!-- --> · <!-- -->Trading &amp; Distribution</p><p class="mt-1 text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">Gujarat<!-- --> · <!-- -->GAP360™ HR &amp; Organisation Design · 6 Months</p><h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Trading &amp; Distribution Business</h3><p class="mt-5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">The Challenge</p><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">A 34% attrition rate was quietly bleeding the business, with unclear roles, inconsistent compensation, and a 45-day hiring cycle.</p><p class="mt-5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">What SBC Did</p><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">SBC designed the complete HR architecture from the ground up — job descriptions, compensation bands, structured hiring, and onboarding.</p><div class="mt-6 flex justify-end"><a href="/case-studies/trading-distribution-business" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Read Full Case Study <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-between bg-ink-wash p-7 md:p-9"><div><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">Results</p><div class="mt-5 space-y-5"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-3xl text-ink">0%→18%</p><p class="mt-2 font-medium text-[11px] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft">Attrition Reduced</p></div><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-3xl text-ink">0→22</p><p class="mt-2 font-medium text-[11px] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft">Days Hiring Cycle</p></div><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-3xl text-ink">₹0L+/yr</p><p class="mt-2 font-medium text-[11px] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft">Attrition Cost Saved</p></div><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-3xl text-ink">0 Months</p><p class="mt-2 font-medium text-[11px] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft">HR Architecture Built</p></div></div></div><div class="mt-6 inline-flex w-fit items-center bg-ink px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-medium leading-snug text-paper">GAP360™ HR &amp; Organisation Design · 6 Months</div></div></article></div></div></div><div><p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold-deep">Institution Building</p><h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">Institutional<br/><span class="text-charcoal/70">Engagements</span></h2><div class="mt-2 h-1 w-10 bg-gold"></div><div class="mt-8 space-y-6"><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><article class="grid border border-ink-tint md:grid-cols-3"><div class="bg-card p-7 md:col-span-2 md:p-9"><p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold-deep">Case Study <!-- -->01<!-- --> · <!-- -->Skill Development / Construction Industry</p><p class="mt-1 text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">Haryana / National<!-- --> · <!-- -->Institutional Development — Full Lifecycle</p><h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Winntus Institute of Formwork Technology (WIFT)</h3><p class="mt-5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">The Challenge</p><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Converting 25 years of expertise into India&#x27;s first formwork-dedicated institution without governance structure or regulatory standing.</p><p class="mt-5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">What SBC Did</p><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Full institutional build across governance, CSDCI/NSQF curriculum, and regulatory credentialing (SIDH, NSDC, CSDCI).</p><div class="mt-6 flex justify-end"><a href="/case-studies/winntus-institute-formwork-technology" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Read Full Case Study <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-between bg-ink-wash p-7 md:p-9"><div><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">Scope of Work</p><ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5"><li class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>WS1 – Institutional Foundation: Governance framework, business model, batch planning, SOPs, college partnership MoU template, launch readiness checklist, WIFT brand brief</li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>WS2 – Curriculum &amp; Academic Framework: CSDCI QP/NOS mapping, NSQF level matrix, program-wise curriculum framework, practical training framework, ToT pathway, assessment &amp; certification design</li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>WS3 – Regulatory Credentialing: SIDH Training Provider registration, NSDC MLP application &amp; grant facilitation, CSDCI affiliation (application, inspection readiness, physical inspection management), NSDC Partnership Certificate</li></ul></div><div class="mt-6 inline-flex w-fit items-center bg-ink px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-medium leading-snug text-paper">Full Lifecycle — Concept to Credentialed Institution · 15–20 Weeks · ₹6,00,000</div></div></article></div></div></div><div><p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold-deep">Feasibility Studies</p><h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">Strategic<br/><span class="text-charcoal/70">Research</span></h2><div class="mt-2 h-1 w-10 bg-gold"></div><div class="mt-8 space-y-6"><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><article class="grid border border-ink-tint md:grid-cols-3"><div class="bg-card p-7 md:col-span-2 md:p-9"><p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold-deep">Case Study <!-- -->01<!-- --> · <!-- -->Finance &amp; Accounting Outsourcing (Proposed Venture)</p><p class="mt-1 text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">Ahmedabad, Gujarat<!-- --> · <!-- -->Independent Feasibility Study — Full Scope</p><h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Finance &amp; Operations Services Venture</h3><p class="mt-5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">The Challenge</p><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Need market validation before capital commitment for subscription-based SMB finance outsourcing.</p><p class="mt-5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">What SBC Did</p><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Three-phase feasibility: market validation, pressure test, and go-forward pricing design.</p><div class="mt-6 flex justify-end"><a href="/case-studies/finance-operations-services-venture" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Read Full Case Study <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-between bg-ink-wash p-7 md:p-9"><div><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">Key Findings</p><ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5"><li class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>Market Size — Gujarat SAM: ~5.6 lakh target-band enterprises. Year-3 SOM: 150–300 clients (capacity-constrained, not market-constrained).</li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>Primary Research — 80% of surveyed SMBs expressed openness to switching. Top barrier: trust, not price. 71.7% prefer monthly retainer model.</li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>Competitive Landscape — No organised domestic FAO competitor targets Ahmedabad SMBs at the proposed price points. Structural white space confirmed.</li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>Regulatory Scope — Entire service portfolio — bookkeeping, GST/TDS, payroll, MIS — sits outside CA-reserved activities. Legally clear and workable.</li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>Pricing Architecture — Three tiers validated against real alternatives: Starter ₹4,999/mo, Growth ₹9,999/mo, Scale ₹21,999/mo. Growth tier beats average current SMB spend of ₹11,402/mo.</li></ul></div><div class="mt-6 inline-flex w-fit items-center bg-ink px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-medium leading-snug text-paper">Feasible — Conditional on Pre-Launch Actions</div></div></article></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><article class="grid border border-ink-tint md:grid-cols-3"><div class="bg-card p-7 md:col-span-2 md:p-9"><p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold-deep">Case Study <!-- -->02<!-- --> · <!-- -->F&amp;B — Specialty Coffee / Café Venture (Proposed)</p><p class="mt-1 text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">Gujarat (Vapi)<!-- --> · <!-- -->Strategic Feasibility — Sourcing &amp; Economics</p><h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Specialty Café &amp; Green Coffee Venture</h3><p class="mt-5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">The Challenge</p><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Determine sourcing economics (domestic vs. imported) before capital investment.</p><p class="mt-5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">What SBC Did</p><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Global FOB pricing analysis, import duty mapping, landed-cost modeling, and competitive benchmarking.</p><div class="mt-6 flex justify-end"><a href="/case-studies/specialty-cafe-green-coffee-venture" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Read Full Case Study <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-between bg-ink-wash p-7 md:p-9"><div><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">Key Findings</p><ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5"><li class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>Import Reality — India&#x27;s effective import duty burden is ~210–220% of CIF value. Best-case landed cost for imported green coffee: ₹880–1,200/kg — 3x domestic Arabica.</li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>Domestic Advantage — Indian Arabica: ₹250–340/kg farmgate. Domestic sourcing delivers a 50–65% structural cost advantage before roasting.</li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>Recommended Sourcing — 80–90% domestic (blends &amp; core SKUs) + 10–20% imported (premium single-origin, limited edition only).</li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>Import Viability Rule — Proceed with imports only if landed cost exceeds ₹1,000/kg AND the product can sell at ₹400–500/kg roasted wholesale or above.</li></ul></div><div class="mt-6 inline-flex w-fit items-center bg-ink px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-medium leading-snug text-paper">Domestic-First Sourcing Strategy</div></div></article></div></div></div></div></section><section id="book" aria-labelledby="cta-heading" class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-gold-wash"><div class="shell"><div data-visible="false" class="reveal mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center"><h2 id="cta-heading" class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.75rem]">Start With a Free 45-Minute Business Audit</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">No commitment. No jargon. Just clarity on where your business stands and what needs to change.</p><a href="/book-free-audit" class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold px-8 py-4 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-gold-tint">Book Your Free Audit <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section></main><footer class="bg-ink text-paper"><div class="shell grid gap-10 py-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,